    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The University in partnership with the Aga Khan Hospital in Dar es Salaam is adding to its postgraduate medical education (PGME) programme in Tanzania to include surgery and internal medicine specialities. Each of these four-year programmes, due to commence in January 2016, are in addition to the already existing programme in family medicine.",
